title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: week_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/kmtpartyorg.jpg
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the KMT has much work to do within it's own party.

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, the KMT also serves as a newspaper, a teacher to the common folk, an ideological hotbed, and a military force. We must cater to our sub-organizations to increase our influence.

- @cadres: Fund our party cadres to increase our campaigning.
- @welfare: Fund more welfare programs in the country.
- @culture: Fund educational and cultural programs.
- @nra: Fund the NRA, our military wing.
- @youth: Support the youth programs.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@cadres
choose-if: funds > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds.
subtitle: -1 funds
on-arrival: funds -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

@welfare
choose-if: funds > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds.
subtitle: -1 funds
on-arrival: funds -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_kmt += 5*(1 - dissent); rural_kmt += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to welfare and aid programs for poor folk.

@culture
choose-if: funds > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds.
subtitle: -1 funds
on-arrival: funds -= 1; cultural_organizations += 1; left_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; center_left_dissent -= 6; right_dissent -= 6; whampoa_dissent -= 6

The KMT can fund educational and cultural programs to let our members and supporters enjoy and learn more about our cause.

@nra
choose-if: funds > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds.
subtitle: -1 funds
on-arrival: funds -= 1; nra_strength  += 10; nra_militancy += 0.01; nra_timer = 0; funded_nra += 1

We have increased recruiting to the NRA.

@youth
choose-if: funds > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds.
subtitle: -1 funds
on-arrival: funds -= 1; nra_strength += 10; nra_militancy += 0.02; left_strength += 5; whampoa_strength += 5; new_middle_kmt += 5 if education >= 2;

Our new youth members flock to the Left or Whampoa wings of the party, and also bring new radicalism to the NRA. [? if education >= 2 : Our education policies have also garnered the support of the new middle class youth. ?]

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
